{{also|toûs|tõus}}
==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|fr}} {{term|tous|lang=frm}} < {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{term|toz|lang=fro}}, equivalent to {{suffix|tout|s|lang=fr|nocat=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* The pronoun:
** {{audio|Fr-tous.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
** {{IPA|/tus/|lang=fr}}
** {{a|Quebec}} {{IPA|/tʊs/|lang=fr}}
* The adjective:
** {{audio|Fr-tout.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
** {{IPA|/tu/|lang=fr}}

===Pronoun===
{{fr-pron}}

# [[all]]
#: ''Ils étaient '''tous''' là.''
#:: They were '''all''' here.
# [[everybody]]
#: '''''Tous''' étaient là.''
#:: '''Everybody''' was here.

====Related terms====
* {{l|fr|tout}}

===Adjective===
{{head|fr|adjective form}}

# {{masculine plural of|tout|lang=fr}}
#: ''Je me brosse les dents '''tous''' les jours.''
#:: I brush my teeth '''every''' day. (Lit: "I brush my teeth '''all''' the days")

====Related terms====
* {{l|fr|tout le monde}}

